    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6aa5c839b7fa8326536618",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石在记者会上表明了自己的距离资质，\n使现场掀起一阵莫大的骚动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e0c5c42a7b77f5509d5dfb7ba140fd5e36285c5f0d2553c623d973b1e9e3d2",
