    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8055d612593416fa8e56131d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这下子经典三冠战线就像没了主角一样，\n应该会陷入一片混乱吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab742d295b819b275a313f0cdbf2a917189284532c36143f3c6583b028743639",
