      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因我的资质如此，我才想挑战三冠路线。\n我想用这双脚跑完剩下的2400及3000米！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e17dee4ed05a3e9fb25024a998cdfb4be18e86efc1e89d0e1316f6bbc358c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005113.json",
      "json_path": [
