      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……或许这是个有勇无谋的选择。2400米\n姑且不提，3000米我可能根本没得比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29748ec12f99f9050fab0dce0efddc40d34e966b4f831c715df650cb4bb22974",
